@*
===========================================================
ORANGE TENDER MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
PAGE: Committee Scoring & Consolidation

DEVELOPER OWNER: Tariq
MODULE: Technical & Financial Evaluation Committee
TRELLO TASK: Committee Scoring & Consolidation
TRELLO URL: https://trello.com/c/zzYbN4wd

PURPOSE:
Show individual member scores, the consolidated evaluation
and ranking, and the 4/4 approval status of the round.

BUSINESS ACCESS:
Evaluation Committee member (assigned to the tender)

ROUTE: /EvaluationCommittee/Evaluations/Scores/{id?}

FUTURE IMPLEMENTATION:
- Scoring service: deterministic, explainable calculation
  from EvaluationScores + EvaluationCriteria weights once
  approved.
- Block finalization on missing scores, ties or an undecided
  formula.
- Bind the approval tracker to CommitteeVotes of this
  CommitteeRound.

DEPENDENCIES:
EvaluationScores, EvaluationCriteria, CommitteeMembers,
CommitteeVotes, CommitteeRounds.

STATUS:
UI SCAFFOLD ONLY — BUSINESS LOGIC NOT IMPLEMENTED.

IMPORTANT:
The system recommends; it never awards. Ollama never
decides.
===========================================================
*@
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Committee Scoring & Consolidation";
    ViewData["WorkspaceSection"] = "Scores";
    ViewData["Description"] = "Each member’s scores, the consolidated result and the four-member approval status.";
}
<partial name="_PageHeader" />
<partial name="_ScaffoldNotice" />

<section class="ws-panel pg-panel" aria-labelledby="tbl-individual-member-scores">
    <div class="pg-panel-head"><h2 id="tbl-individual-member-scores">Individual member scores</h2></div>
    <div class="pg-table-wrap">
        <table class="pg-table">
            <thead><tr><th scope="col">Supplier</th><th scope="col">Criterion</th><th scope="col">Member 1</th><th scope="col">Member 2</th><th scope="col">Member 3</th><th scope="col">Member 4</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody><tr><td colspan="6"><partial name="_EmptyState" model='"No scores entered yet."' /></td></tr></tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="ws-panel pg-panel" aria-labelledby="tbl-consolidated-evaluation">
    <div class="pg-panel-head"><h2 id="tbl-consolidated-evaluation">Consolidated evaluation</h2></div>
    <div class="pg-table-wrap">
        <table class="pg-table">
            <thead><tr><th scope="col">Rank</th><th scope="col">Supplier</th><th scope="col">Technical score</th><th scope="col">Financial score</th><th scope="col">Final score</th><th scope="col">Eligible</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody><tr><td colspan="6"><partial name="_EmptyState" model='"The ranking appears only after the scoring method is finalized and all scores are entered."' /></td></tr></tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</section>

<aside class="pg-note"><strong>Scoring method not decided</strong><p>The weighting method, aggregation of the four members’ scores and tie handling are open decisions. When any of them is missing, the system must block finalization instead of guessing.</p></aside>

<partial name="_ApprovalTracker" model='"Evaluation Committee"' />
